got to know what was the problem and how to resolve itThe main trick was that n was even.
prime1 = 2
prime2 = n / 2
Then I calculated:
phi = (prime1 - 1) * (prime2 - 1)
Since prime1 is 2:phi = prime2 - 1
Then I calculated d:d = e^(-1) mod phi
After getting d I decrypted the ciphertext using:
m = c^d mod n
where c is the ciphertext.
